## Tooling

The rules are executable, not just prose. From the repo root:

```
node scripts/build.mjs "<brief>" --out out/          # the slopify verb
node scripts/audit.mjs <file.html | dir>             # the audit verb
node scripts/corporatize.mjs <file.html> --out out/  # the corporatize verb
node scripts/harvest.mjs <url | shot.png> --out out/ # the harvest verb
node scripts/score.mjs <file.html> [--json]          # the 57 gates, scored
```

`score.mjs` exits non-zero when the score is below 57.
